'' A tuple type written inside SIZEOF is parsed as a type, so its elements are checked:
'' an 'any' element is TKO0823, not an internal error.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/sizeof-tuple-type-any.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: sizeof-tuple-type-any.bas(2,16): error TKO0823: a tuple element cannot be 'any' or a fixed-length string
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0994
